!                                                                                                   
! This test calculates the NMR spin-spin couplings in the water molecule                            
! The no-pair approach is used, so that we calculate the DSO term via the                           
! Sternheimer approximation. The same calculation can then also be done                             
! via the RELCCSD code and serves as an extra check.                                                
! Note that we consistently leave out the SS integrals by specifying .INTFLG under Hamiltonian.     
!                                                                                                   
**DIRAC                                                                                             
.TITLE                                                                                              
Water molecule. Restricted kinetic balance. Spin-spin couplings                                     
.WAVE F                                                                                             
.PROPER                                                                                             
.4INDEX                                                                                             
**HAMILTONIAN                                                                                       
.BSS                                                                                                
2999                                                                                                
.CMPEIG                                                                                             
*AMFI                                                                                               
.PRNT_A                                                                                             
0                                                                                                   
.PRNT_S                                                                                             
0                                                                                                   
.MXITER                                                                                             
45                                                                                                  
.AMFICH                                                                                             
0                                                                                                   
**WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                                    
.SCF                                                                                                
.RELCCSD                                                                                            
**PROPERTIES                                                                                        
.SPIN-SPIN                                                                                          
.DSO                                                                                                
*LINEAR RESPONSE                                                                                    
.SKIPEP                                                                                             
.CNVINT                                                                                             
0.01 0.0001                                                                                         
.THRESH                                                                                             
1.0E-8                                                                                              
**MOLTRA                                                                                            
.ACTIVE                                                                                             
all                                                                                                 
.PRPTRA                                                                                             
*PRPTRA                                                                                             
.OPERATOR                                                                                           
 'SPI01H'                                                                                           
 YAVECTOR                                                                                           
 'NEF 002'                                                                                          
 'NEF 006'                                                                                          
 CMULT                                                                                              
 COMFACTOR                                                                                          
 -1.0D0                                                                                             
.OPERATOR                                                                                           
 'SPI02O'                                                                                           
 YAVECTOR                                                                                           
 'NEF 004'                                                                                          
 'NEF 001'                                                                                          
 CMULT                                                                                              
 COMFACTOR                                                                                          
 -1.0D0                                                                                             
.OPERATOR                                                                                           
 'SPI03H'                                                                                           
 YAVECTOR                                                                                           
 'NEF 005'                                                                                          
 'NEF 003'                                                                                          
 CMULT                                                                                              
 COMFACTOR                                                                                          
 -1.0D0                                                                                             
.OPERATOR                                                                                           
 'SPI04O'                                                                                           
 XAVECTOR                                                                                           
 'NEF 001'                                                                                          
 'NEF 007'                                                                                          
 CMULT                                                                                              
